==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|constituens}}, present participle of {{term|constituo||I establish}} < {{term|com-||together}} + {{term|statuo||I set, place, establish}}; see [[statute]] or [[statue]], and cf. [[institute]] and [[restitute]].

